@startuml
title Semana 4 - Integración con Repositorio de Datos Compartido\nCatálogo de Medicamentos

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Usuario

package "Módulo Catálogo de Medicamentos" {

    package "Presentation" {
        component "MedicationController" as Controller
        component "catalog.php\nVista" as View
    }

    package "Application" {
        component "RegisterMedication" as Register
        component "SearchMedications" as Search
        component "ToggleMedicationStatus" as Toggle
    }

    package "Domain" {
        component "Medication" as Medication
        interface "MedicationRepository" as Repository
    }

    package "Infrastructure / Persistence" {
        component "PdoMedicationRepository" as PDORepo
        component "InMemoryMedicationRepository" as MemoryRepo
        component "SharedMedicationRepository\nAdaptador futuro" as SharedRepo
    }
}

cloud "Sistema Hospitalario Integrado" as HIS

database "Repositorio de datos\ncompartido" as SharedDatabase

Usuario --> Controller
Controller --> Register
Controller --> Search
Controller --> Toggle
Controller --> View

Register --> Repository
Search --> Repository
Toggle --> Repository

Register --> Medication
Toggle --> Medication

PDORepo ..|> Repository
MemoryRepo ..|> Repository
SharedRepo ..|> Repository

SharedRepo --> HIS : integración
HIS --> SharedDatabase : acceso a datos

note right of Repository
Contrato estable del dominio.

Los casos de uso no necesitan
conocer dónde se almacenan
los medicamentos.
end note

note right of SharedRepo
Este adaptador podría utilizar
API, servicio interno o conexión
autorizada al repositorio compartido.
end note

note bottom of SharedDatabase
El repositorio compartido puede
ser utilizado por otros módulos
del Sistema Hospitalario Integrado.
end note

@enduml